{
  "_comment": "MiniMax-H3-Image (open weights, 2026-11-10): text to image and multi-reference editing with one checkpoint (API format). Comfy-Org's templates image_minimax_h3_image_t2i.json / image_minimax_h3_image_edit.json without their prompt-enhancer branch (Qwen3.5 9B + Generate Text): MiniMaxH3ImageConditioning with up to ten pictures (<Picture N> in the prompt), ConditioningZeroOut for the negative (the model takes no negative prompt), KSampler 6 steps / CFG 1 / euler / simple (the checkpoint is distilled to 6 steps without guidance), the image VAE. The text encoder is the H3 video graphs' own file (the model uses the MiniMax-H3 text encoder unchanged), so the pod downloads only the DiT and the VAE. The painter sets the canvas (node 5 width / height: the asked shape scaled up to the model's 4 MP working area, image_models.json min_area) and drops the unused picture slots. LoRAs are chained by the painter between node 1 and node 7 (image_models.json lora_after / lora_into). Needs ComfyUI v0.45.0 or later.",
